<title>SOUTH KOREA: Steel mill plan needs S.Korean government approval.</title>
<headline>Steel mill plan needs S.Korean government approval.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>In a veiled blow to the Hyundai Group's goal of building its own steel mill, the Finance Minister said on Thursday that domestic companies which want to enter the steel industry would need government approval.</p>
<p>&quot;Any company that wants to enter the steel industry will need government approval to develop the site,&quot; Kang Kyong-shik told reporters.</p>
<p>Analysts said government help would be needed to secure soft loans from the state-run Korea Development Bank for facilities investment.</p>
</text>
